			<div class="content" id="post-content-4855852">
									

<p>An Automaton of unknown origin, inexplicably in operational condition. Creates increasingly complex geometric patterns that grab the eye and boggle the mind.</p>
<p><em>I moved and trimmed your thread summary, since it was taking up extra space in the main forum screen. Try to keep thread descriptions (the text in the little box under the thread title) and titles short so you don't crowd out other authors in the forum listing. ~Zyn</em></p>
<p><strong>Seeking Greenlight:</strong> Yes</p>
<p><strong>Page Type:</strong> SCP Article</p>
<p><strong>Genre (Optional):</strong> Cosmic Horror mystery</p>
<p>Elevator Pitch:<br />
SCP-XXXX is a functional Automaton, appearing to be from the 1800s. It resembles a small child writing at a desk, to which it is attached. Upon supplying SCP-XXXX with paper and ink for the attached pen and turning the crank, the crank will lock in place. However, it has been discovered through intense physical manipulation and scientific reasoning, that SCP-XXXX will respond to particular audio frequencies, all of which are outside the audible spectrum. It will then activate autonomously and begin drawing with extreme precision until its internal potential energy is exhausted.</p>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;show&nbsp;block</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">–&nbsp;hide&nbsp;block</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>Central Narrative:<br />
The story laying under the surface of this strange artifact as well as many others that will come is the story of the Architect. A person from an unknown time and place that has found a way to harness mathematics and geometry into a form of literal magic. Though the Architect's whereabouts and physicality are yet unknown, there are many strange, otherworldly objects that lend themselves to prove his existence.</p>
<p>Associate SCP concepts-<br />
- The architect’s Automaton Known<br />
- The arithmetic sigils (x3) Unknown<br />
- The Arithmicon Unknown<br />
- The huntsmen Unknown<br />
- The Lead Knights Unknown<br />
- The Tide Unknown<br />
- The face of god Unknown<br />
- The seed of Eden Unknown<br />
- The black moor Unknown<br />
- The eye of Yog Unknown<br />
- The traveler's cube Unknown</p>
<p>Hook/Attention-Grabber:<br />
The drawings it produces vary wildly dependent on the frequency given to it and will grow in complexity with each subsequent process. It has been noted that attempting to investigate and calculate these geometric patterns will result in Dissociative Amnesia, Psychosis, Dementia, Alzheimer's syndrome, and many other effects. This is seemingly at random, and no two cases are alike but in one distinct factor. Each of the subjects exposed to the drawings seems to experience delusions and dreams of a masked figure cloaked in black.</p>
<p>Additional Notes:<br />
It is not yet known what happens when SCP-XXXX is allowed to finish one of its patterns, but it is certainly best left to conjecture.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
